  "messages": [
    {
      "sequence": 2,
      "role": "assistant",
      "interrupted": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-10T11:39:53.338289+00:00",
      "source_at": "2026-10-10T11:39:46.098+00:00",
      "exchange_id": "2",
      "content": "Good evening, Omkar. I'm Ritu calling on behalf of omkar as per your request yesterday, is this a good time?"
    },
    {
      "sequence": 1,
      "role": "user",
      "interrupted": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-10T11:40:47.454476+00:00",
      "source_at": "2026-10-10T11:40:40.578+00:00",
      "exchange_id": "5",
      "content": "I'm not like I I meant in the agent like what are the next things remaining to build."
    },
    {
      "sequence": 1,
      "role": "user",
      "interrupted": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-10T11:41:37.75338+00:00",
      "source_at": "2026-10-10T11:41:34.334+00:00",
      "exchange_id": "6",
      "content": "uh Yeah, so you can send me a WhatsApp."
    },
    {
      "sequence": 1,
      "role": "user",
      "interrupted": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-10T11:42:08.954212+00:00",
      "source_at": "2026-10-10T11:42:07.071+00:00",
      "exchange_id": "10",
      "content": "Yeah, sure."
    },
    {
      "sequence": 2,
      "role": "assistant",
      "interrupted": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-10T11:42:21.961627+00:00",
      "source_at": "2026-10-10T11:42:11.438+00:00",
      "exchange_id": "10",
      "content": "Done. The WhatsApp has been sent to [phone number removed]. You should receive it shortly. Is there anything else you need?"
    },
    {
      "sequence": 1,
      "role": "user",
      "interrupted": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-10T11:39:46.048298+00:00",
      "source_at": "2026-10-10T11:39:44.731+00:00",
      "exchange_id": "2",
      "content": "Hello."
    },
    {
      "sequence": 1,
      "role": "user",
      "interrupted": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-10T11:40:33.607567+00:00",
      "source_at": "2026-10-10T11:40:29.875+00:00",
      "exchange_id": "4",
      "content": "What are the next steps remaining?"
    },
    {
      "sequence": 2,
      "role": "assistant",
      "interrupted": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-10T11:41:33.193815+00:00",
      "source_at": "2026-10-10T11:40:47.489+00:00",
      "exchange_id": "5",
      "content": "Right. In the agent itself, a few things are still being worked on. One issue is that after an interruption, unspoken text can enter the conversation history because the Sarvam websocket TTS adapter lacks word timestamps or text alignment metadata. The plan is to approximately align text with audio playback to fix that. Next, Omkar is looking at higher compute hosting like Oracle or a similar service, improving credential rotation and health monitoring, and cleaning up the dashboard UI with more external tool integrations and richer callback workflows. These are priorities, not finished work, and nothing here is guaranteed or deployed yet. Would you like me to send the dashboard link on WhatsApp, or do you have questions about any of this?"
    },
    {
      "sequence": 2,
      "role": "assistant",
      "interrupted": true,
      "created_at": "2026-10-10T11:41:47.667028+00:00",
      "source_at": "2026-10-10T11:41:45.795+00:00",
      "exchange_id": "7",
      "content": "I need the full number to send it. Could you share the complete number, including the country code?"
    },
    {
      "sequence": 1,
      "role": "user",
      "interrupted": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-10T11:41:48.84349+00:00",
      "source_at": "2026-10-10T11:41:47.431+00:00",
      "exchange_id": "8",
      "content": "It"
    },
    {
      "sequence": 1,
      "role": "user",
      "interrupted": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-10T11:42:33.08749+00:00",
      "source_at": "2026-10-10T11:42:31.121+00:00",
      "exchange_id": "12",
      "content": "No, wrong. No, I'm done."
    },
    {
      "sequence": 1,
      "role": "user",
      "interrupted": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-10T11:39:56.892822+00:00",
      "source_at": "2026-10-10T11:39:54.972+00:00",
      "exchange_id": "3",
      "content": "Yeah, hello."
    },
    {
      "sequence": 2,
      "role": "assistant",
      "interrupted": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-10T11:40:28.760969+00:00",
      "source_at": "2026-10-10T11:39:57.182+00:00",
      "exchange_id": "3",
      "content": "Sure. Let me briefly explain what Omkar has built. It’s a platform for creating voice agents that can hold conversations, send WhatsApp follow-ups and arrange callbacks and meetings on google calendar. This call runs through a Waveshare modem for cellular calling and a pipecat based runtime. The dashboard lets you configure the agent and inspect what happened during a call. the current call is using sarvams STT TTS and saravam conversations llm model. Would you like to hear about any other interesting engineering choices or architecture details?"
    },
    {
      "sequence": 2,
      "role": "assistant",
      "interrupted": true,
      "created_at": "2026-10-10T11:40:40.839363+00:00",
      "source_at": "2026-10-10T11:40:33.923+00:00",
      "exchange_id": "4",
      "content": "The next steps depend on what you need. If you want to explore the dashboard, I can send the link on WhatsApp. If you have technical questions, I can arrange a short call with Omkar. Or if you know someone else who should be involved, I can save a referral. What would you prefer?"
    },
    {
      "sequence": 1,
      "role": "user",
      "interrupted": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-10T11:41:55.84917+00:00",
      "source_at": "2026-10-10T11:41:49.462+00:00",
      "exchange_id": "9",
      "content": "[phone number removed]."
    },
    {
      "sequence": 2,
      "role": "assistant",
      "interrupted": false,
      "created_at": "2026-10-10T11:42:44.390721+00:00",
      "source_at": "2026-10-10T11:42:33.475+00:00",
      "exchange_id": "12",
      "content": "Thank you for the opportunity to talk. Omkar learned a lot about voice agents and went quite deep into the engineering of this project, so he really appreciates the opportunity. Have a pleasant evening."
    },
    {
      "sequence": 2,
      "role": "assistant",
      "interrupted": true,
      "created_at": "2026-10-10T11:41:38.673218+00:00",
      "source_at": "2026-10-10T11:41:37.795+00:00",
      "exchange_id": "6",
      "content": "Of course. I can send the WhatsApp to the same number we're speaking on now. May I go ahead?"
    },
    {
      "sequence": 2,
      "role": "assistant",
      "interrupted": true,
      "created_at": "2026-10-10T11:41:49.676411+00:00",
      "source_at": "2026-10-10T11:41:48.881+00:00",
