      "created_at": "2026-10-10T11:42:04.416985+00:00",
      "source_at": "2026-10-10T11:41:55.894+00:00",
      "exchange_id": "9",
      "content": "Just to confirm, I will send the WhatsApp to [phone number removed]. Is that correct?"
